  + preserve the exact distinction between an update proposal, fresh physical admission, bounded mutation, authoritative post-state verification, independent acceptance, rollback attempt, quarantine, and later publication
  + select candidate profile cantor-self-work-physical-update-broker/0.1 for full SJS formation only
  + do not infer implementation or live-write authority from this source selection

& [Problem]
  + SWA-04A proves supplied-form integrity and emits representation_only prepared_awaiting_physical_revalidation proposals
  + no current product surface immediately revalidates that proposal against a fresh Phase3A observation and owns the single-use transition into a bounded writer
  + no current product surface joins a physical writer record to an independently observed post-state, explicit acceptance disposition, or honest rollback/quarantine outcome
  + the historical Phase3B and Phase3C specifications are formation-only, bind an older App Server assessment, and explicitly require renewed authority plus target-host physical proof
  + therefore Cantor cannot yet truthfully claim that it performs its own update

& [RequiredStageSeparation]
  + [SWA-04B0] pure broker protocol, lifecycle, capability-account, receipt, and deterministic fixture formation
  + [SWA-04B1] read-only target-host interface identity, schema, sandbox, path, process, and admission preflight under separate activation authority
  + [SWA-04B2] one bounded writer in one disposable admitted candidate under separate local-effect authority
  + [SWA-04B3] stopped-writer quiescence, direct post-state observation, exact proposed-versus-observed reconciliation, and immutable evidence under separate observation and evidence-write authority
  + [SWA-04B4] independent acceptance or refusal over immutable evidence without mutation, publication, or self-approval authority
  + [SWA-04B5] separately commissioned rollback attempt when reversible, followed by independent reobservation; otherwise preserve quarantine without cleanup
  + each stage has its own exact capability grant, input identity, output receipt, fault boundary, and activation signature
  - never: sign or activate all physical stages merely because their complete formation is coherent

& [RequiredInputBinding]
  + accept one exact current cantor-self-work-update-handoff-proposal/0.1 whose authority remains representation_only and whose disposition remains prepared_awaiting_physical_revalidation
  + bind the complete SWA-03 lifecycle request, checkpoint, selected step, attempt, SWA-04A request, proposal, proposed path changes, evidence, and unresolved authority account by exact digest
  + rerun current Phase3A candidate-workspace admission immediately before any writer launch and require exact claim, request, base, branch, Git, root, policy, budget, and allowlist correspondence
  + authenticate any physical admission receipt according to its own current authority; structural self-consistency alone is insufficient
  + claim the handoff identity and admission nonce exactly once before any physical transition

& [BrokerAuthorityModel]
  + represent read observation, evidence-root write, candidate mutation, process launch, interrupt, terminate, test execution, acceptance, rollback attempt, cleanup, Git history, commit, push, provider, SOP authorship, signature, activation, persistence, remote, FPGA, and Minecraft as distinct closed capabilities
  + every request carries an exact granted and explicitly-not-granted account
  + no receipt, model report, event, digest, equality, passing test, or prior signature grants a capability not present in the current stage commission
  + the mutating worker cannot issue its own fresh admission, verify its own post-state, accept its own result, commission rollback, clean the candidate, commit, push, or activate a succeeding SOP
  + a Cantor-generated succeeding SOP remains an attributable proposal for later SWA-06 review

& [BoundedWriterFormation]
  + reuse the historical Phase3B prevention-versus-detection honesty boundary without treating formation signature 99201d16-5d09-4707-8c9d-7efb24f8cc63 as implementation authority
  + one pinned exact App Server child, one ephemeral thread, one workspace-write no-network approval-never turn, one exact candidate cwd, no additional writable root, no retry, no steering, and finite time event byte command file-change and tool budgets form the maximum writer shape
  + exact current executable, version, protocol schema, environment, sandbox response, process ownership, interruption, terminal, and cleanup behavior must be re-audited before activation
  + command and file-change notifications are reactive observations rather than proof of pre-write prevention or authoritative post-state
  + after turn start, every fault retains may_have_mutated true or unknown and requires quarantine until independent observation

& [PostStateVerificationFormation]
  + reuse the historical Phase3C capability separation and direct-inventory intent without treating formation signature 41fb35cf-8c3b-4179-a51d-dad96e77a8a9 as implementation authority
  + require exact child termination and owned-descendant accounting before capture
  + directly observe repository identity HEAD full branch ref Git common directory index tree porcelain state untracked and ignored paths and every in-scope physical path
  + reject link reparse mount hard-link alternate-stream special-file alias outside-policy index ref common-directory and principal-worktree uncertainty
  + reconcile the complete proposed change set against the complete observed change set including content mode addition modification deletion and unexpected residue
  + publish immutable content-addressed evidence only to an independently admitted bounded evidence root under a separately granted capability
  + an equality result is evidence about the observed candidate state and is not acceptance, commit, push, deployment, or current-world truth after observation

& [AcceptanceAndRollbackFormation]
  + deterministic non-waivable integrity lineage path special-file repository test and unresolved-authority gates precede any independent judgment
  + the independent reviewer receives immutable evidence and no mutable candidate handle, writer identity, rollback capability, Git-history capability, publication capability, signature key, or activation capability
  + accepted_for_later_publication_consideration, refused_preserve, quarantined, rollback_requested, rollback_verified, rollback_incomplete, and unresolved remain distinct dispositions
  + rollback means a separately commissioned bounded attempt followed by the same independent observation grammar; it never means reset, checkout, clean, deletion, or claimed restoration without exact proof
  + failed, interrupted, partial, ambiguous, or out-of-policy mutation preserves evidence and the candidate without automatic cleanup

